WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.471 --> 00:00:06.740
Getting anything better down there,
Johnny?

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:08.942
A lot of bent rods.

00:00:08.942 --> 00:00:11.077
So we're just getting set up right now
on the regal sword.

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:14.314
We made the move down from crab ledge
last night.

00:00:14.581 --> 00:00:16.549
Might just set up right in here.

00:00:16.549 --> 00:00:17.217
Yeah.

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:19.886
You know, you just get panic

00:00:19.886 --> 00:00:23.490
in panic mode about not getting
the paycheck and going home, we’re

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:26.760
90 miles away, a lot of fuel, you know,

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:29.295
probably 4 to $600 worth of fuel.

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:31.364
You just want to make a paycheck.

00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:33.967
You want to be in the black
by the time the trip's over.

00:00:34.067 --> 00:00:37.437
We came down here to pick up right
where we left off last season,

00:00:37.737 --> 00:00:39.873
but so far, that hasn't been the case.

00:00:40.073 --> 00:00:43.877
I'm really feeling the pressure to get
some meat on deck and defend our title

00:00:45.378 --> 00:00:46.312
lock in,

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:48.681
we’re marking.

00:00:58.491 --> 00:01:00.393
Yeah buddy!

00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:02.195
be the right one.

00:01:02.195 --> 00:01:04.164
Go, go.

00:01:04.164 --> 00:01:06.733
There you go.

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:14.240
We need this fish bad.

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:15.642
We've got to get one today.

00:01:15.642 --> 00:01:17.911
We already got guys ahead of us
on the leaderboard.

00:01:18.244 --> 00:01:19.279
A nice big fish here.

00:01:19.279 --> 00:01:21.481
We'll certainly make up some ground.

00:01:21.481 --> 00:01:25.652
We've got a lot of work
to do to land this one, though.

00:01:26.086 --> 00:01:28.388
Want me to take over for a bit Johnny?

00:01:28.388 --> 00:01:28.988
You got.

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:29.189
Yeah.

00:01:29.189 --> 00:01:31.324
Go nuts.

00:01:34.994 --> 00:01:36.362
Yeah, baby.

00:01:36.362 --> 00:01:37.564
Whoo!

00:01:37.564 --> 00:01:40.533
Yeah we've been doing a lot of reverse
right now.

00:01:40.533 --> 00:01:42.202
Just trying to keep up with this fish.

00:01:42.202 --> 00:01:43.870
He's just plugging away.

00:01:43.870 --> 00:01:47.440
So hopefully we can eventually
get this fish straight up and down

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:50.310
and fight him how we want.

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:52.011
Forward.

00:01:52.011 --> 00:01:54.447
Oh, **** you ******* kidding me?

00:01:54.447 --> 00:01:56.015
What the ****

00:01:56.015 --> 00:01:58.051
that's around his tail.

00:01:58.051 --> 00:02:01.254
Oh, I'll jump in for a while, Jonny.

00:02:01.254 --> 00:02:07.594
Yeah, he's kind of all over the place.

00:02:07.594 --> 00:02:08.728
He just kind of keeps wanting

00:02:08.728 --> 00:02:12.265
to go to one direction, sweep the board
in reverse the whole time on them.

00:02:12.699 --> 00:02:15.869
He won't settle into anything here,
so we want to get him up and down,

00:02:15.869 --> 00:02:17.170
but we can't.

00:02:17.403 --> 00:02:19.939
We're on a real one this time, you know,
no small fish today.

00:02:20.573 --> 00:02:21.574
We need to get this one.

00:02:21.574 --> 00:02:23.943
There's a few people already
on the leaderboard ahead of us.

00:02:24.144 --> 00:02:26.613
You know, there's only a limited days
we can fish this year.

00:02:26.846 --> 00:02:28.381
We've got to make sure every fish counts.

00:02:28.381 --> 00:02:30.783
And we need to get this fish badly.

00:02:30.783 --> 00:02:33.052
This fish is acting like a jerk.

00:02:33.052 --> 00:02:34.120
If I'm being honest.

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:36.756
They kept swimming away and away and away.

00:02:36.756 --> 00:02:39.025
We finally got him up and down here.

00:02:39.959 --> 00:02:41.561
He's gotta be wrapped, so be ready.

00:02:42.529 --> 00:02:43.029
Oh, yeah.

00:02:43.029 --> 00:02:45.131
Oh, yeah.

00:02:46.466 --> 00:02:47.400
Here you go manny.

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:48.635
He was hooked in the tail.

00:02:48.635 --> 00:02:51.337
Holy **** he was hooked in the tail!
Oh my God.

00:02:51.371 --> 00:02:54.574
Holy crap are you kidding me?

00:02:54.574 --> 00:02:55.175
Oh, my God.

00:02:55.175 --> 00:02:56.809
He's a monster.

00:02:57.877 --> 00:02:59.646
Here we go baby!

00:02:59.646 --> 00:03:00.747
Yeah!

00:03:00.747 --> 00:03:02.248
Needed that one boys.

00:03:02.248 --> 00:03:04.217
Needed that one.
We knew it was a heavy fish.

00:03:04.217 --> 00:03:06.119
Just because you can feel
the weight on the line,

00:03:06.119 --> 00:03:08.188
but you could feel the paddle,
the tail the whole time.

00:03:08.188 --> 00:03:09.422
But he wasn't tail wrapped.

00:03:09.422 --> 00:03:12.325
We figured it was fowl hook somewhere,
but the hook is in the tail.

00:03:12.759 --> 00:03:14.093
Look at that.

00:03:14.093 --> 00:03:17.130
Well, that right
there is some damn good luck.

00:03:19.499 --> 00:03:21.434
Oh, we needed that.

00:03:21.434 --> 00:03:23.136
Must be nice.

00:03:23.136 --> 00:03:26.005
Fat Tuna just got one.
Uh jealous!

00:03:26.573 --> 00:03:28.308
So jealous.

00:03:28.308 --> 00:03:29.342
Whenever you're ready.

00:03:29.342 --> 00:03:32.378
Oh, yeah. Here we go boys.
Whoa he is round.

00:03:32.579 --> 00:03:34.247
Let's put a tape on it.

00:03:34.247 --> 00:03:40.720
95. Heck yeah, boys.

00:03:40.720 --> 00:03:41.254
Nice.

00:03:41.988 --> 00:03:42.655
Heck yeah!

00:03:42.655 --> 00:03:44.324
All day long.

00:03:44.324 --> 00:03:45.792
Let's get this guy cleaned out.

00:03:45.792 --> 00:03:47.860
Ice up. Let's head home, baby.

00:03:49.162 --> 00:03:51.164
That's incredible.

